The issue is that the `TestMax` method declaration is missing its body, and the body appears later as an orphaned block. Let me fix this by attaching the body to the `TestMax` method.

@@ method TestMax(a: int, b: int) @@
+ {
+   var result := Max(a, b);
+   assert result == a || result == b;
+   assert result >= a && result >= b;
+ }
 lemma MaxCommutative(a: int, b: int)
@@ assert Max(Max(a, b), c) == Max(a, Max(b, c)); @@
 }
